      "fork": false,
      "note": "vendored verbatim, no longer a content fork. On 2026-09-13 the operator replaced the 300-line local rewrite with upstream skills/herdr at commit 2746ac7 (one file, byte-identical to what `herdr --skill` prints on v0.9.0), and lastComparedTreeHash is that directory's tree hash. Stays vendored rather than npx-tracked because it was already a chezmoi-delivered store entry with hermes fan-out; a future refresh is copy upstream over the file and advance the hash."
